    "prompt": "Create one portrait9:19.5 iPhone wallpaper 'Velvet Observatory'. Attached real red cloth photo is MATERIAL REFERENCE only. Original luxurious understated photographic scene: deep burgundy almost-black velvet, soft tiny pile and broad gentle folds concentrated in lower45%, upper55% calm flat dark-wine velvet negative space for apps. Across bottom third a few very fine antique-brass orbital arcs lie on fabric, one small ivory pearl-like planet and tiny subtle brass spherical bead, selectively lit by low warm light, hint of an antique astronomical instrument partially cropped out at bottom edge. Fine copper light on one fabric fold, shadows deep aubergine. Beautiful still-life material photography, classic observatory collection aesthetic, not fantasy space landscape. No crescent moon or giant planet dominating wallpaper, no stars sprayed everywhere, no tassels, no flowers, no text, symbols, UI, logos or borders. Dark readable restrained upper area; rich tactile interest low down. Warm brass and ivory against black cherry velvet, controlled natural highlights, no gaudy gold/glitter/neon.",
